s3:s2:a1i |- ( V e. TMSt -> TMra = ( v e. TMSt |-> ( 1st ` ( 2nd ` v ) ) ) )
s4::fveq2 |- ( v = V -> ( 2nd ` v ) = ( 2nd ` V ) )
s5:s4:fveq2d |- ( v = V -> ( 1st ` ( 2nd ` v ) ) = ( 1st ` ( 2nd ` V ) ) )
s6:s5:adantl |- ( ( V e. TMSt /\ v = V ) -> ( 1st ` ( 2nd ` v ) ) = ( 1st ` ( 2nd ` V ) ) )
