s8:s3,s6,s1,s7:fvmptd |- ( V e. TMSt -> ( TMra ` V ) = ( 1st ` ( 2nd ` V ) ) )
s9::df-tmst |- TMSt = ( 2o X. ( ( 2o |_| 1o ) X. ( ( 2o |_| 1o ) X. ( 2o X. ( 2o X. ( 3o X. 2o ) ) ) ) ) )
s10:s1,s9:eleqtrdi |- ( V e. TMSt -> V e. ( 2o X. ( ( 2o |_| 1o ) X. ( ( 2o |_| 1o ) X. ( 2o X. ( 2o X. ( 3o X. 2o ) ) ) ) ) ) )
i11::xp2nd
