i13::xp1st
s14:s12,i13:syl |- ( V e. TMSt -> ( 1st ` ( 2nd ` V ) ) e. ( 2o |_| 1o ) )
qed:s8,s14:eqeltrd |- ( V e. TMSt -> ( TMra ` V ) e. ( 2o |_| 1o ) )
